Fix duplicated agent stream and agent filter mismatch on restore

- Deduplicate concurrent session/load per session (loadSessionOnce). After a
  restart, resume-session and the send path both loaded the same session,
  making the CLI subscribe twice and emit every chunk twice.
- When restoring the last chat whose agent differs from the browser's
  persisted filter, switch the filter to the chat's agent.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
